.TH grokbot-tui-completions 1  "completions " 
.SH NAME
grokbot\-tui\-completions \- Print a shell completion script to stdout: bash, zsh, fish, powershell or elvish (e.g. `source <(grokbot\-tui completions bash)`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgrokbot\-tui completions\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISHELL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a shell completion script to stdout: bash, zsh, fish, powershell or elvish (e.g. `source <(grokbot\-tui completions bash)`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISHELL\fR>

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
bash
.IP \(bu 2
elvish
.IP \(bu 2
fish
.IP \(bu 2
powershell
.IP \(bu 2
